--[[
    WindUI v1.6.66 - Ye Performance Build r3 (fail-open)
    Base library: Footagesus/WindUI (MIT)
    Official release pinned: v1.6.66

    Performance changes:
    1. Cache the official WindUI source locally.
    2. Cache the unified WindUI Main-v2 icon library in NightHub_Cache/WindUI_Icons.
    3. Debounce Squircle AbsoluteSize recalculation.
    4. Batch NewElements shape refreshes during mass control creation.
    5. Keep the window root at a stable size during Open / Close.
       Only animate the lightweight background shell + transparency.
    6. Apply SetSize / fullscreen size / UIScale in one step instead of
       tweening the whole UI tree through many intermediate sizes.

    This build deliberately avoids hard version / structure validation.
    If an optimization patch does not match, it is skipped. If the optimized
    source cannot start, the untouched official WindUI source is executed.
]]

